--[[
The WoW Forever items Blizzard's item API already publishes, from id 200,000
up, as the site held them on 2026-11-24: 11,770 ids in 2,147 ranges, each
written "low-high" or as one id. Items.lua notes only an item that is not
among them, so a session's item observations all go to items the site has
no page for. On 24 November 2026 the owner's first file from 0.2.12 held 400
item observations, the session's whole allowance, and 340 of them were items
the site already had from Blizzard.

The list goes stale as Blizzard adds items, and that is harmless both ways: a
listed item is one the site has, and an item Blizzard has added since is
noted here and left alone by the site, which adds a page only where it holds
none. It is data, not code: the ids are the site's own public database's,
and nothing here is read from the player's game.
]]

